Z||000006||ur2biteme||01-12-2001||05:15 AM||||The wheels you have on your car are in fact, 14".  i have the same ones on my car.  the only 15" wheels that had that design were on the firebird, and had a different bolt pattern and offset, set up for rear wheel drive.  they wont fit the fiero without modification, and i dont think they would look right afterward.  besides, it would be too much trouble to go through to put wheels on that were so close to the originals anyway.  <P>nice car though.  looks to be similar condition to an '84 i almost got instead of my '87.  in a way, i wish i did.  oh well.  <P>------------------<BR>Bob's '87 econo coupe<BR>170k awaiting a tranny:(<BR>http://members.fortunecity.com/ur2biteme||||reg||1
